<title>USA: Omaha cattle not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>No test on slaughter steers or</p>
<p>heifers. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $.50-1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>For the week: Slaughter steers and heifers $0.50-$1.00 higher.</p>
